<title>JAPAN: Niigata Chuo Bank - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Niigata Chuo Bank - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    22.91		vs	   27.34</p>
<p> Operating	    5.15		vs	    5.02</p>
<p> Current		1.27		vs	    1.40</p>
<p> Net		  553    million    vs	  548    million</p>
<p> EPS		    5.92 yen	  vs	    5.86 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     93 million	  vs	  93 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.00 yen	  vs	    2.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Niigata Chuo Bank Ltd is a regional bank based in Niigata.</p>
</text>
